  "core_concepts": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "term": "经验损失最小化",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "幻灯片把神经网络预测写成 f(x;w)，以误差函数 ℓ 比较预测与目标，并对 N 个训练样本取平均得到损失；目标是寻找使该损失最小的 w。本讲随后明确只研究 full-batch optimization。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\mathcal{L}(w)=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\ell\\!\\left(f(x^{(i)};w),y^{(i)}\\right)",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 4
          }
        },
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "term": "二阶 Taylor 局部模型",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "多种经典优化方法以损失在 w 附近的 Taylor 展开为共同起点；g 是 d 维梯度，H 是 d×d Hessian。后续方法的差别来自保留的阶数、曲率近似和给更新施加的几何。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 10
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\mathcal{L}(w+\\Delta w)=\\mathcal{L}(w)+g^T\\Delta w+\\frac{1}{2}\\Delta w^T H\\Delta w+\\cdots",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 10
          }
        },
        "warnings": [
          "由渲染页视觉核对；原生文本层丢失了多处运算符和上下标。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "term": "Newton 步",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "最小化二阶局部模型并令其对 Δw 的导数为零，得到用逆 Hessian 预条件梯度的 Newton 步。幻灯片同时提醒：方法可能走向局部极大值，且 d 个参数产生 d×d Hessian，即使小网络也可能过于昂贵。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 11
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 12
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "g+H\\Delta w=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\Delta w=-H^{-1}g",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 11
          }
        },
        "warnings": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "term": "Gauss–Newton 分解与近似",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "对复合目标 L=ℓ∘f，Hessian 可分为由误差函数曲率经模型 Jacobian 拉回的项，以及由模型自身二阶导数产生的项。平方损失使误差曲率为单位阵；忽略模型曲率便得到幻灯片所示的 Gauss–Newton 步。其代价是额外求导，而且忽略模型曲率是否安全并无保证。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 13
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 14
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 15
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "H=J_f^T H_{\\ell}J_f+\\sum_k\\frac{\\partial\\ell}{\\partial f_k}\\nabla_w^2 f_k;\\qquad \\Delta w_{GN}=-(J_f^TJ_f)^{-1}g\\;\\text{（平方损失）}",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 14
          }
        },
        "warnings": [
          "用 J_f 与 H_ℓ 重写幻灯片逐项偏导记号；未改变两项分解或平方损失更新。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "term": "一般最速下降",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "把二阶非线性部分换成 λ/2·||Δw||² 后，更新取决于所选范数。二范数给出普通梯度下降，无穷范数给出符号梯度下降；一般情形的步长由梯度的对偶范数决定，方向是在单位范数球上使 gᵀt 最大的方向的反向。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 16
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 17
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 18
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 19
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\arg\\min_{\\Delta w}\\left[g^T\\Delta w+\\frac{\\lambda}{2}\\lVert\\Delta w\\rVert^2\\right]=-\\frac{\\lVert g\\rVert_*}{\\lambda}\\arg\\max_{\\lVert t\\rVert=1}g^Tt",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 19
          }
        },
        "warnings": [
          "负号与对偶范数均由渲染页核对。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "term": "谱范数",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "谱范数回答矩阵最多能把向量的欧氏范数放大多少；幻灯片指出它等于最大奇异值。这提供了从神经计算转向矩阵尺度控制的接口。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 21
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 23
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\lVert M\\rVert_*=\\max_{v\\ne0}\\frac{\\lVert Mv\\rVert_2}{\\lVert v\\rVert_2}=\\sigma_{\\max}(M)",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 23
          }
        },
        "warnings": [
          "沿用幻灯片以星号表示谱范数的记号。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "term": "RMS–RMS 算子范数",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "向量 RMS 范数把二范数除以维数平方根。对应的 RMS–RMS 算子范数衡量矩阵对输入 RMS 的最大放大；对从 d_in 维映射到 d_out 维的矩阵，它与谱范数相差 √(d_in/d_out)。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 24
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\lVert v\\rVert_{RMS}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt d}\\lVert v\\rVert_2,\\qquad \\lVert M\\rVert_{RMS\\to RMS}=\\sqrt{\\frac{d_{in}}{d_{out}}}\\lVert M\\rVert_*",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 24
          }
        },
        "warnings": [
          "维度比由渲染页底部练习式核对。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "term": "谱控制的宽度缩放启发式",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "幻灯片把“宽度改变时移除最优学习率漂移”明确标为 claim，并建议每层初始化满足 ||W_l||_{RMS→RMS}≈1、更新满足 ||ΔW_l||_{RMS→RMS}≈1。本 StudyKit 将它保留为讲者给出的启发式主张，而不是已证明的普适定理。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 25
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\lVert W_l\\rVert_{RMS\\to RMS}\\sim1,\\qquad\\lVert\\Delta W_l\\rVert_{RMS\\to RMS}\\sim1",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 25
          }
        },
        "warnings": [
          "未使用或复述页面中的第三方图形数据；只转述视觉可见的讲者手写 claim 与两条规则。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "term": "深度缩放的残差参数化",
      "claim_type": "source_summary",
      "explanation": "深度缩放页以“the trick seems to be”作限定，回顾 (1+x/L)^L 的指数极限，并建议把残差块写成 x↦x+(1/L)·layer(x)；页末同时标注仍需更多研究。因此这里把它当作研究启发，而非性能保证。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 26
          }
        }
      ],
      "formula": {
        "status": "resolved",
        "latex": "\\lim_{L\\to\\infty}\\left(1+\\frac{x}{L}\\right)^L=e^x,\\qquad x\\mapsto x+\\frac{1}{L}\\operatorname{layer}(x)",
        "citation": {
          "source_id": "mit6-7960-f24-lec7-d9137f6191",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 26
          }
        },
